#: templates/core/about.html:10
msgid ""
"The platform uses a simple, fixed pricing model with a federation-configured "
"visit charge and labour charge. Material cost is always paid directly by the "
"customer to the supplier — the platform never touches it."
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/about.html:11
